## 5.2 Menampilkan Detail Product

**Pembuka:** setelah daftar produk, sekarang halaman detail produk. Ketika salah satu produk di daftar diklik, aplikasi membuka halaman detailnya.

### Langkah 1 - Membuat UI Detail Product

Buat file `detail_product_page.dart` di folder `lib/page/product/`.

`lib/page/product/detail_product_page.dart`

```dart
import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'package:flutter_bloc/flutter_bloc.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/bloc/product/product_cubit.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/core/constants/app_config.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/core/utils/currency_helper.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/resource/model/rating_model.dart';
import 'package:flutter_widget_from_html/flutter_widget_from_html.dart';
import 'package:go_router/go_router.dart';

class DetailProductPage extends StatelessWidget {
  const DetailProductPage({super.key});

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    return Scaffold(
      body: _buildProductDetail(context),
      floatingActionButton: _buildFloatingActionButton(context),
    );
  }

  /// Detail Produk
  Widget _buildProductDetail(BuildContext context) {
    return BlocBuilder<ProductCubit, ProductState>(
      builder: (context, state) {
        return state.maybeWhen(
          loading: () => const Center(child: CircularProgressIndicator()),
          loadedDetailProduct: (product) {
            return ListView(
              children: [
                _buildImageBanner(product.image, context),
                const SizedBox(height: 16),
                Padding(
                  padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 16.0),
                  child: _buildProductInfo(product),
                ),
                const SizedBox(height: 16),
                Padding(
                  padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 16.0),
                  child: _buildDescription(product.description),
                ),
                const SizedBox(height: 16),
                Padding(
                  padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 16.0),
                  child: _buildReviewSection(product.ratings),
                ),
              ],
            );
          },
          orElse: () => const Center(child: Text('Something went wrong')),
        );
      },
    );
  }

  Widget _buildImageBanner(String? imageUrl, BuildContext context) {
    return Stack(children: [
      ClipRRect(
          borderRadius: const BorderRadius.only(
              bottomLeft: Radius.circular(20),
              bottomRight: Radius.circular(20)),
          child: Image.network(
            '${AppConfig.STORAGE_IMAGE}$imageUrl',
            width: double.infinity,
            height: 300,
            fit: BoxFit.cover,
          )),
      Positioned(
        top: 16,
        left: 8,
        child: IconButton.filled(
          icon: const Icon(Icons.arrow_back_ios_new),
          color: Colors.white,
          onPressed: () {
            context.pop();
          },
        ),
      ),
    ]);
  }

  Widget _buildProductInfo(product) {
    return Column(
      crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
      children: [
        Text(
          product.title ?? "",
          style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 24, fontWeight: FontWeight.bold),
        ),
        const SizedBox(height: 8),
        Row(
          mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.spaceBetween,
          children: [
            Text(
              CurrencyHelper.formatRupiah(product.price?.toDouble() ?? 0),
              style: TextStyle(
                fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                fontSize: 16,
                color: Colors.green.shade700,
              ),
            ),
            Row(
              children: [
                const Icon(Icons.star, color: Colors.amber, size: 16),
                Text(
                    '${product.ratingsAvgRating} (${product.ratings?.length} Reviews)'),
              ],
            ),
          ],
        ),
      ],
    );
  }

  Widget _buildDescription(String? description) {
    return Column(
      crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
      children: [
        const Text(
          'Description',
          style: TextStyle(fontSize: 16, fontWeight: FontWeight.bold),
        ),
        HtmlWidget(description ?? ""),
      ],
    );
  }

  Widget _buildReviewSection(List<RatingModel>? ratings) {
    return Column(
      crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
      children: [
        const Text(
          'Ratings & Reviews',
          style: TextStyle(fontSize: 16, fontWeight: FontWeight.bold),
        ),
        const SizedBox(height: 8),
        ratings == null || ratings.isEmpty
            ? _buildNoReviewMessage()
            : _buildReviewList(ratings),
      ],
    );
  }

  Widget _buildNoReviewMessage() {
    return Container(
      padding: const EdgeInsets.all(8.0),
      decoration: BoxDecoration(
        color: Colors.grey.shade200,
        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(20),
      ),
      child: const Center(child: Text("No reviews available")),
    );
  }

  Widget _buildReviewList(List<RatingModel> ratings) {
    return ListView.separated(
      padding: const EdgeInsets.only(top: 2),
      shrinkWrap: true,
      physics: const NeverScrollableScrollPhysics(),
      itemCount: ratings.length,
      itemBuilder: (context, index) {
        final review = ratings[index];
        return _buildReviewItem(review);
      },
      separatorBuilder: (context, index) => const Padding(
        padding: EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 16.0),
        child: Divider(color: Colors.black, thickness: 1),
      ),
    );
  }

  Widget _buildReviewItem(RatingModel review) {
    return Container(
      decoration: BoxDecoration(
        color: Colors.grey.shade200,
        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(20),
      ),
      padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 16.0, vertical: 8),
      child: Column(
        crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
        children: [
          Row(
            children: [
              CircleAvatar(
                backgroundImage: NetworkImage(
                    '${AppConfig.STORAGE_AVATAR}${review.customer?.image}'),
                radius: 20,
              ),
              const SizedBox(width: 8),
              Expanded(
                child: Text(
                  review.customer?.name ?? "",
                  style: const TextStyle(
                      fontWeight: FontWeight.bold, fontSize: 16),
                ),
              ),
              _buildStarRating(review.rating ?? 0),
            ],
          ),
          const SizedBox(height: 8),
          Text(review.review ?? ""),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }

  Widget _buildStarRating(int rating) {
    return Row(
      children: List.generate(5, (i) {
        return Icon(
          i < rating ? Icons.star : Icons.star_border,
          color: Colors.amber,
          size: 24,
        );
      }),
    );
  }

  Widget _buildFloatingActionButton(BuildContext context) {
    return BlocBuilder<ProductCubit, ProductState>(
      builder: (context, state) {
        return state.maybeWhen(
          loadedDetailProduct: (product) => FloatingActionButton.extended(
            onPressed: () {},
            label: const Text('Add to Cart',
                style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white)),
            icon: const Icon(Icons.add_shopping_cart, color: Colors.white),
          ),
          orElse: () => const SizedBox(),
        );
      },
    );
  }
}
```

**Penjelasan wajib per bagian:**

- **`StatelessWidget`:** tidak ada perubahan UI yang dikelola di dalam widget, jadi semua dirender langsung.
- **`build`:** parent layout `Scaffold`. `body` diisi `_buildProductDetail` sebagai konten utama, dan `floatingActionButton` berisi `_buildFloatingActionButton`.
- **`_buildProductDetail`:** `BlocBuilder<ProductCubit, ProductState>`. Saat `loading` tampil spinner, saat `loadedDetailProduct` tampil `ListView` berisi banner gambar, info produk, deskripsi, dan bagian ulasan. State lain tampil "Something went wrong".
- **`_buildImageBanner`:** `Stack` berisi gambar tinggi 300 dengan sudut bawah membulat 20, dan tombol back `IconButton.filled` di pojok kiri atas yang memanggil `context.pop()`.
- **`_buildProductInfo`:** judul (ukuran 24, tebal), baris harga berwarna hijau lewat `CurrencyHelper.formatRupiah`, dan rating bintang dengan jumlah review.
- **`_buildDescription`:** deskripsi produk berformat HTML dirender memakai `HtmlWidget` dari package `flutter_widget_from_html`.
- **`_buildReviewSection`:** judul "Ratings & Reviews". Jika ulasan kosong tampil `_buildNoReviewMessage` ("No reviews available"), jika ada tampil `_buildReviewList`.
- **`_buildReviewList`:** `ListView.separated` dengan `shrinkWrap: true` dan `NeverScrollableScrollPhysics` supaya ikut scroll halaman, diberi `Divider` hitam antar item.
- **`_buildReviewItem`:** kartu abu-abu membulat berisi avatar pelanggan (`AppConfig.STORAGE_AVATAR`), nama, bintang rating (`_buildStarRating`, 5 ikon bintang terisi atau kosong), dan teks ulasan.
- **`_buildFloatingActionButton`:** tombol "Add to Cart" hanya tampil saat state `loadedDetailProduct`. Isi `onPressed` masih kosong.

