## 5.3 Menampilkan List Data Products By Category

**Pembuka:** di materi ini ditampilkan daftar produk sesuai kategori. Ketika salah satu kategori di halaman home diklik, aplikasi membuka daftar produk kategori tersebut.

### Langkah 1 - Membuat UI List Data Products

Buat file `product_by_category_page.dart` di folder `lib/page/product`.

`lib/page/product/product_by_category_page.dart`

```dart
import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'package:flutter_bloc/flutter_bloc.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/bloc/category/category_cubit.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/core/components/product_card.dart';
import 'package:go_router/go_router.dart';

class ProductByCategoryPage extends StatefulWidget {
  final String categoryName;
  const ProductByCategoryPage({super.key, required this.categoryName});

  @override
  State<ProductByCategoryPage> createState() => _ProductByCategoryPageState();
}

class _ProductByCategoryPageState extends State<ProductByCategoryPage> {
  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    return Scaffold(
      appBar: AppBar(
        backgroundColor: Theme.of(context).colorScheme.primary,
        leading: IconButton(
          onPressed: () {
            context.pop();
          },
          icon: const Icon(Icons.arrow_back_ios_new, color: Colors.white),
        ),
        title: Text(
          'Product In ${widget.categoryName}',
          style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white),
        ),
      ),
      body: BlocBuilder<CategoryCubit, CategoryState>(
        builder: (context, state) {
          return state.maybeWhen(
            initial: () => const Center(child: CircularProgressIndicator()),
            loading: () => const Center(child: CircularProgressIndicator()),
            loadedCategoryBySlug: (category) =>
                category.products?.isNotEmpty == true
                    ? ListView.builder(
                        itemCount: category.products?.length,
                        itemBuilder: (context, index) {
                          final product = category.products![index];
                          return Padding(
                            padding:
                                const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 16.0),
                            child:
                                ProductCard(product: product, isPopular: false),
                          );
                        },
                      )
                    : const Center(child: Text('Product not found')),
            error: (message) => Center(child: Text(message)),
            orElse: () => const Center(child: Text('Something went wrong')),
          );
        },
      ),
    );
  }
}
```

**Penjelasan wajib per bagian:**

- **Import:** `flutter_bloc`, `category_cubit.dart`, `product_card.dart`, dan `go_router`.
- **`ProductByCategoryPage` (`StatefulWidget`):** menerima parameter `categoryName` yang dipakai sebagai judul `AppBar` ("Product In ...").
- **`AppBar`:** tombol back dan judul berdasarkan kategori yang dipilih.
- **`BlocBuilder<CategoryCubit, CategoryState>`:** membangun ulang tampilan setiap kali `CategoryCubit` mengeluarkan state baru, `maybeWhen` menangani state secara selektif.
- **State handling:** `initial` dan `loading` menampilkan indikator loading. `loadedCategoryBySlug` menampilkan daftar produk jika ada (`category.products`), atau "Product not found" jika kosong. `error` menampilkan pesan error. `orElse` adalah fallback.
- **`ProductCard(product: product, isPopular: false)`:** komponen kustom yang menampilkan info produk.

### Langkah 2 - Membuat Navigasi

Tambahkan route `/productByCategory` di `app_router.dart`:

```dart
GoRoute(
  path: '/productByCategory',
  builder: (context, state) {
    final category = state.extra as CategoryModel;
    return BlocProvider(
      create: (context) => CategoryCubit(homeRemoteResource)
        ..fetchCategoryBySlug(category.slug ?? ''),
      child: ProductByCategoryPage(categoryName: category.name ?? ''),
    );
  },
),
```

Penjelasan: data kategori dibawa lewat `extra` (dari `CategoryCard`). `slug` dipakai untuk memanggil `fetchCategoryBySlug`, `name` dikirim sebagai `categoryName`.

Sehingga semua kode pada `app_router.dart` menjadi berikut (versi akhir Bab 8).

`lib/app_router.dart`

```dart
import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'package:flutter_bloc/flutter_bloc.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/bloc/auth/auth_bloc.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/bloc/category/category_cubit.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/bloc/order/order_cubit.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/bloc/product/product_cubit.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/bloc/profile/profile_bloc.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/bloc/review_product/review_product_cubit.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/page/auth/login_page.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/page/auth/register_page.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/page/dashboard/cart_page.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/page/dashboard/dashboard_page.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/page/dashboard/home_page.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/page/dashboard/order_page.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/page/dashboard/profile_page.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/page/midtrans/midtrans_payment_page.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/page/order/order_detail_page.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/page/product/all_product_page.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/page/product/detail_product_page.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/page/product/product_by_category_page.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/resource/model/category_model.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/resource/remote/home_remote_resource.dart';
import 'package:flutter_foodstore/resource/remote/order_remote_resource.dart';
import 'package:go_router/go_router.dart';

class AppRouter {
  final AuthBloc authBloc;
  final OrderRemoteResource orderRemoteResource;
  final HomeRemoteResource homeRemoteResource;

  AppRouter({
    required this.authBloc,
    required this.orderRemoteResource,
    required this.homeRemoteResource,
  });

  late final GoRouter router = GoRouter(
    refreshListenable: GoRouterRefreshStream(authBloc.stream),
    initialLocation: '/dashboard/home',
    redirect: (context, state) {
      final authState = authBloc.state;
      final isLoggedIn = authState is Authenticated;
      final protectedRoutes = [
        '/dashboard/order',
        '/dashboard/profile',
        '/dashboard/cart',
        '/order',
        '/checkout',
      ];

      final isProtected = protectedRoutes
          .any((route) => state.matchedLocation.startsWith(route));

      if (!isLoggedIn && isProtected) return '/login';

      if (isLoggedIn && state.matchedLocation == '/login') {
        return '/login';
      }

      return null;
    },
    routes: [
      ShellRoute(
        builder: (_, __, child) => DashboardPage(child: child),
        routes: [
          GoRoute(
            path: '/dashboard/home',
            builder: (_, __) {
              return HomePage();
            },
          ),
          GoRoute(
            path: '/dashboard/order',
            builder: (context, state) {
              context.read<OrderCubit>().fetchOrders(isRefresh: true);
              return OrderPage();
            },
          ),
          GoRoute(
            path: '/dashboard/cart',
            builder: (context, state) {
              return CartPage();
            },
          ),
          GoRoute(
            path: '/dashboard/profile',
            builder: (context, state) {
              context.read<ProfileBloc>().add(ProfileEvent.loadProfile());
              return ProfilePage();
            },
          ),
        ],
      ),
      GoRoute(
        path: '/login',
        builder: (_, __) => const LoginPage(),
      ),
      GoRoute(
        path: '/register',
        builder: (_, __) => RegisterPage(),
      ),
      GoRoute(
        path: '/orderDetail/:snapToken',
        builder: (context, state) {
          final snapToken = state.pathParameters['snapToken'] ?? '';
          return MultiBlocProvider(
            providers: [
              BlocProvider(
                create: (context) =>
                    OrderCubit(orderRemoteResource)..detailOrder(snapToken),
              ),
              BlocProvider(
                create: (context) => ReviewProductCubit(
                  orderRemoteResource,
                ),
              ),
            ],
            child: OrderDetailPage(),
          );
        },
      ),
      GoRoute(
        path: '/midtransPayment/:snapToken',
        builder: (context, state) {
          return MidtransPaymentPage(
            snapToken: state.pathParameters['snapToken'] ?? '',
          );
        },
      ),
      GoRoute(
        path: '/allProducts',
        builder: (context, state) => BlocProvider(
          create: (context) =>
              ProductCubit(homeRemoteResource)..fetchProduct(isRefresh: true),
          child: AllProductPage(),
        ),
      ),
      GoRoute(
        path: '/detailProduct/:slug',
        builder: (context, state) {
          return BlocProvider(
            create: (context) => ProductCubit(homeRemoteResource)
              ..detailProduct(state.pathParameters['slug'] ?? ''),
            child: DetailProductPage(),
          );
        },
      ),
      GoRoute(
        path: '/productByCategory',
        builder: (context, state) {
          final category = state.extra as CategoryModel;
          return BlocProvider(
            create: (context) => CategoryCubit(homeRemoteResource)
              ..fetchCategoryBySlug(category.slug ?? ''),
            child: ProductByCategoryPage(categoryName: category.name ?? ''),
          );
        },
      ),
    ],
  );
}

class GoRouterRefreshStream extends ChangeNotifier {
  GoRouterRefreshStream(Stream stream) {
    stream.listen((_) {
      notifyListeners();
    });
  }
}
```

> Catatan untuk AI: pada `redirect`, kondisi `isLoggedIn && state.matchedLocation == '/login'` mengembalikan `'/login'`. Itu sesuai kode sumber, jangan diubah. Route `/dashboard/cart` masih `return CartPage();` tanpa `CartBloc`, itu dilengkapi di Bab 9.

### Langkah 3 - Pengujian

Restart aplikasi (restart penuh, bukan hot reload), lalu pilih salah satu kategori di halaman home. Aplikasi membuka halaman "Product In ..." berisi produk pada kategori tersebut.

**Ringkasan Bab 8 (tulis di akhir bab):** pembaca sudah membuat tiga halaman produk: daftar semua produk dengan paginasi "Load More", detail produk lengkap dengan deskripsi HTML dan ulasan, serta daftar produk berdasarkan kategori. Ketiga halaman terhubung lewat route baru di `AppRouter` yang sekarang juga menerima `HomeRemoteResource`.

